01:43:57,430 --> 01:44:08,380
Is someone up there?

1626
01:44:08,380 --> 01:44:13,510
Should I go up there?

1627
01:44:13,510 --> 01:44:23,670
Horses just disappear in an instant, so I decided it's better not to get attached — same as with ARK,

1628
01:44:23,670 --> 01:44:28,700
same as with the dinosaurs in ARK,

1629
01:44:28,700 --> 01:44:33,110
same as with Desmodus in ARK,

1630
01:44:33,110 --> 01:44:37,480
I figured getting attached means losing

1631
