1657
01:47:44,230 --> 01:47:46,550
It's too dark to tell

1658
01:47:46,550 --> 01:47:58,580
If Haz-Mat Suit were in the car, I could just go straight there

1659
01:47:58,580 --> 01:48:02,710
Blueberries

1660
01:48:02,710 --> 01:48:05,680
Nope, that's not it

1661
01:48:05,680 --> 01:48:07,780
I ran over a bear here, so maybe this way

1662
01:48:07,780 --> 01:48:24,150
Heave-ho

1663
