Luna-senpai one-shotted it!

1691
01:51:39,090 --> 01:51:45,810
Congrats!

1692
01:51:45,810 --> 01:51:51,180
With one punch?

1693
01:51:51,180 --> 01:51:54,990
She actually hit it?

1694
01:51:55,190 --> 01:52:04,010
That's crazy, the final circle has been terrifying lately

1695
01:52:04,010 --> 01:52:15,500
