1696
01:52:15,500 --> 01:52:18,670
Outside, outside!

1697
01:52:18,670 --> 01:52:23,470
There it is! 1, 2 — enough for 4 people!

1698
01:52:23,470 --> 01:52:44,850
Whoa! Supplies for 4! There's enough for 4!

1699
01:52:44,850 --> 01:52:52,290
Oh wait, that's not it. Sui-chan's sortie. Sui-chan was scary, wasn't she. Was it F6?

1700
01:52:52,290 --> 01:52:58,110
Gotta remember that. Gotta keep that as a warning to myself.

1701
01:52:58,110 --> 01:53:01,890
That was genuinely a little scary.

1702
01:53:02,430 --> 01:53:14,090
Good thing we're alive — life is everything

1703
01:53:14,090 --> 01:53:23,290
The target's toward the desert. Should I turn the car around and drive there?

1704
01:53:23,290 --> 01:53:33,020
Let's go find some good loot — the loot just up and left on me out of nowhere

1705
01:53:33,020 --> 01:53:41,040
But the loot is alive — Zeta's red buri

1706
01:53:41,320 --> 01:53:43,320
Next time I'll find even better loot

1707
01:53:43,320 --> 01:53:46,640
I'll find loot that actually has good loot

1708
01:53:46,640 --> 01:53:51,920
