1712
01:53:58,480 --> 01:54:02,920
And and and it's surprised!

1713
01:54:02,920 --> 01:54:06,360
Polka just pinned Shadow

1714
01:54:06,360 --> 01:54:10,480
Some people get aggressive when they hold a gun

1715
01:54:10,480 --> 01:54:12,240
