1716
01:54:12,240 --> 01:54:21,050
Giving up

1717
01:54:21,050 --> 01:54:30,360
Where even are we, Shadow?

1718
01:54:30,360 --> 01:54:32,340
Just a little more

1719
01:54:32,340 --> 01:54:33,920
Hang in there, you can do it!

1720
01:54:33,920 --> 01:54:34,720
Go go go!

1721
01:54:34,720 --> 01:54:36,280
It's totally holding up, totally holding

1722
01:54:36,280 --> 01:54:37,440
It's completely holding right now

1723
01:54:37,440 --> 01:54:39,460
Great, wonderful

1724
01:54:39,460 --> 01:54:40,140
Perfect

1725
01:54:40,140 --> 01:54:42,140
Perfect! Oh!

1726
01:54:42,140 --> 01:54:47,360
Supplies!

1727
01:54:47,360 --> 01:54:52,280
It's not about the supplies right now... ah! Watch out, deer jumping out! Deer jumping out!

1728
01:54:52,280 --> 01:54:56,200
What kind of psychopath is this? Oh, it's a psychopath

1729
01:54:56,200 --> 01:54:58,960
