1730
01:54:58,960 --> 01:55:00,800
The psychopath that isn't Sui-chan

1731
01:55:00,800 --> 01:55:03,600
There are so many psychopaths today! Why?

1732
01:55:03,600 --> 01:55:07,540
Because Sui-chan showed up?

1733
01:55:07,540 --> 01:55:09,540
Her friends came along?

1734
01:55:12,080 --> 01:55:14,080
