1761
01:56:48,370 --> 01:56:50,350
Wait, is that a horse?

1762
01:56:50,350 --> 01:56:53,920
Oh, that is a horse!

1763
01:56:53,920 --> 01:56:59,150
No, maybe not quite...

1764
