1766
01:57:03,110 --> 01:57:07,230
Don't get spotted!

1767
01:57:12,950 --> 01:57:14,030
Don't get spotted.

1768
01:57:14,030 --> 01:57:18,660
By the way, do the horses have original names?

1769
01:57:18,660 --> 01:57:21,880
Could you check real quick and let me know?

1770
01:57:21,880 --> 01:57:26,080
The horses, um, probably...

1771
01:57:26,080 --> 01:57:29,800
I think all the horses have their own original names,

1772
01:57:29,800 --> 01:57:35,330
