1774
01:57:36,710 --> 01:57:46,700
Keep.

1775
01:57:46,700 --> 01:57:49,680
Keep's horse?

1776
01:57:50,320 --> 01:57:52,280
The one near Miri's area.

1777
01:57:52,280 --> 01:57:58,400
Deep something...

1778
01:57:58,400 --> 01:57:58,820
OK.

1779
01:57:58,820 --> 01:58:02,500
Deep Impact.

1780
01:58:02,500 --> 01:58:03,380
Got it.

1781
01:58:03,380 --> 01:58:05,280
But probably

1782
01:58:05,280 --> 01:58:08,220
over in this radiation zone corner

1783
01:58:08,220 --> 01:58:09,700
