1784
01:58:09,700 --> 01:58:11,560
After all, there's not much cover here.

1785
01:58:11,560 --> 01:58:17,420
Wait, is that a horse?

1786
01:58:17,420 --> 01:58:20,590
Is that a horse?

1787
01:58:20,590 --> 01:58:22,410
