1796
01:58:40,170 --> 01:58:41,670
Red.

1797
01:58:41,670 --> 01:58:43,870
Is that Red Roan?

1798
01:58:43,870 --> 01:58:47,250
It's not Red Roan though.

1799
01:58:47,250 --> 01:58:49,050
It's more like...

1800
01:58:49,050 --> 01:58:51,070
