1801
01:58:51,070 --> 01:59:00,850
Kind of similar. Just a little, but yeah, it's still giving Deep Impact vibes. That's what I'm looking for.

1802
01:59:00,850 --> 01:59:17,380
Haven't been out this far in a while.

1803
01:59:17,380 --> 01:59:23,970
OK to turn here, right?

1804
01:59:23,970 --> 01:59:28,580
Is that the horse I saw earlier?

1805
01:59:28,580 --> 01:59:32,040
Looks like the horse from before.

1806
01:59:38,770 --> 01:59:42,850
Alright, let's do this!

1807
01:59:42,850 --> 01:59:47,590
For the horse!

1808
01:59:47,590 --> 01:59:51,350
Make Debut gacha time!

1809
01:59:51,350 --> 01:59:59,080
Isn't this the car Nene wanted?

1810
01:59:59,080 --> 02:00:04,400
Isn't this the car Nene wanted?

1811
02:00:04,400 --> 02:00:08,460
Can you store stuff in this?

1812
02:00:08,960 --> 02:00:11,760
