1824
02:01:23,430 --> 02:01:29,150
And the durability is dropping like crazy.

1825
02:01:29,150 --> 02:01:32,790
Oh no, oh no, oh no!

1826
02:01:32,790 --> 02:01:35,660
What a troublesome little kitty.

1827
02:01:35,660 --> 02:01:36,850
Honestly.

1828
02:01:36,850 --> 02:01:46,230
Is there any? Any? Any?

1829
02:01:46,230 --> 02:01:52,840
I need to get back to the garage fast or the car's gonna die.

1830
02:01:52,840 --> 02:02:07,970
At a glance—

1831
02:02:07,970 --> 02:02:10,290
A boar!

1832
02:02:10,290 --> 02:02:11,250
A boar!

1833
02:02:11,250 --> 02:02:13,370
Is that a person? A psycho?

1834
02:02:13,370 --> 02:02:18,630
A psycho!

1835
02:02:18,630 --> 02:02:22,790
A boar!

1836
02:02:22,790 --> 02:02:28,340
Is that loot?

1837
02:02:28,340 --> 02:02:30,980
Is that supplies?

1838
02:02:30,980 --> 02:02:32,360
Wait, could it be—

1839
02:02:32,360 --> 02:02:35,880
Oh sorry, sorry, sorry!

1840
02:02:35,880 --> 02:02:37,840
I don't have time to deal with you right now!

1841
02:02:37,840 --> 02:02:42,790
It ran away when it saw a chunk of iron.

1842
02:02:42,790 --> 02:02:47,140
No distractions.

1843
02:02:47,140 --> 02:02:53,340
It's just sitting out in the open so boldly.

1844
02:02:53,340 --> 02:02:54,760
Oh, what are you gonna do?

1845
02:02:54,760 --> 02:02:58,580
Nice.

1846
