What are you holding?

1847
02:03:01,720 --> 02:03:03,060
How many?

1848
02:03:03,060 --> 02:03:08,460
I was looking for a different horse.

1849
02:03:08,460 --> 02:03:10,620
What are you doing, doing something like this?

1850
02:03:10,620 --> 02:03:13,280
Doing this won't bring the horse back.

1851
02:03:13,280 --> 02:03:18,480
What's the point of doing this?

1852
02:03:18,480 --> 02:03:20,140
The horse isn't coming back.

1853
02:03:20,140 --> 02:03:31,800
Leave the pineapple in there.

1854
02:03:31,800 --> 02:03:33,560
You can put clothes in on top too.

1855
02:03:33,560 --> 02:03:36,900
Doing this won't bring the horse back.

1856
02:03:36,900 --> 02:03:38,300
Let's just stop already.

1857
02:03:38,300 --> 02:03:40,480
What a waste of a horse.

1858
02:03:40,480 --> 02:03:43,260
There is no horse!

1859
02:03:43,260 --> 02:03:45,060
That's not the issue here.

1860
02:03:45,060 --> 02:03:46,300
There's no horse!

1861
02:03:46,300 --> 02:03:48,780
Flare, we don't need this right now.

1862
02:03:48,780 --> 02:03:51,520
This isn't the time for that.

1863
02:03:51,520 --> 02:03:54,600
Like, when you rev the car engine like vroom vroom,

1864
02:03:54,600 --> 02:03:58,080
