1868
02:04:04,200 --> 02:04:09,270
The horse won't walk.

1869
02:04:09,270 --> 02:04:17,560
Wait.

1870
02:04:17,560 --> 02:04:19,660
Maybe if we kill a boar, it'll respawn?

1871
02:04:19,660 --> 02:04:26,140
I'm starting to feel like it might work.

1872
02:04:26,140 --> 02:04:27,780
Oh.

1873
02:04:27,780 --> 02:04:30,440
This one's the strongest.

1874
02:04:30,440 --> 02:04:31,880
This, this one.

1875
02:04:31,880 --> 02:04:34,640
This guy's powerful.

1876
02:04:34,640 --> 02:04:37,880
Water?

1877
02:04:37,880 --> 02:04:41,310
This one,

1878
02:04:41,310 --> 02:04:42,410
